 
 PEDIT filename

  ESC             Enter command
  t         Go to top of file
  b         Go to bottom of file
  l n       Go to line n
  f         Find
  a         Find again
  z         Clear marks
  c n       Mark lines of copy
  p         Paste copied lines
  m         Move copied lines
  d n       Delete n lines
  w         Write file
  q         Write file and quit
  k         Kill (quit without writing)
  ?,h       Help